WEBVTT

00:02.080 --> 00:06.490
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

01:32.160 --> 01:35.750
<b>That bag... What is inside it, really?</b>

01:32.360 --> 01:36.820
<b>Naughtiness = Happiness</b>

01:36.120 --> 01:39.500
<b>Charo, you have
a little sister back home, right?</b>

01:42.500 --> 01:44.550
<b>I also have an older sister.</b>

01:45.260 --> 01:47.070
<b>Have you heard about it
from the Great Demon Lord?</b>

01:48.010 --> 01:50.590
<b>About the incident that
happened in the Evans family...</b>

01:51.600 --> 01:53.310
<b>Yes... About that...</b>

01:53.890 --> 01:56.700
<b>Your sister committed
a terrible deed, and...</b>

01:56.700 --> 01:58.020
<b>That is false!</b>

01:58.560 --> 02:00.250
<b>My sister wouldn't even kill a bug!</b>

02:00.250 --> 02:02.480
<b>There's no way she would
do something like that!</b>

02:03.820 --> 02:05.630
<b>I'm sure that rotten prince</b>

02:05.730 --> 02:08.610
<b>set something up in order to
trick my sister into doing it.</b>

02:09.590 --> 02:11.740
<b>Even so, that Evans family</b>

02:12.030 --> 02:14.120
<b>chose to abandon my sister.</b>

02:15.540 --> 02:18.310
<b>You don't hate your sister?</b>

02:18.310 --> 02:19.830
<b>Don't say such stupid things!</b>

02:20.370 --> 02:22.750
<b>The person I hate is the one
who couldn't save the Evans family</b>

02:23.630 --> 02:27.010
<b>or her own sister.
The person I hate is myself.</b>

02:29.470 --> 02:31.650
<b>Ever since I was born, my sister</b>

02:32.010 --> 02:33.600
<b>had always been treating me well.</b>

02:35.930 --> 02:37.520
<b>But, one day...</b>

02:38.560 --> 02:40.850
<b>I couldn't do anything.</b>

02:42.020 --> 02:46.080
<b>That's why I wanted to help
my sister once I've gotten older,</b>

02:46.360 --> 02:47.650
<b>but I didn't make it in time.</b>

02:48.530 --> 02:50.710
<b>My sister disappeared.</b>

02:52.160 --> 02:53.240
<b>Natalia...</b>

02:54.070 --> 02:57.370
<b>Due to that incident, all of my
sister's belongings were disposed of.</b>

02:57.950 --> 02:59.290
<b>This is the only thing remaining.</b>

03:00.160 --> 03:01.680
<b>Because of this,</b>

03:01.830 --> 03:05.420
<b>I can sense through magic that
my sister is still alive somewhere.</b>

03:05.960 --> 03:08.560
<b>A spell to find a missing person?</b>

03:09.170 --> 03:10.920
<b>I've read about it in a book before.</b>

03:11.380 --> 03:14.430
<b>Yeah... I don't know
who in the world did it,</b>

03:14.760 --> 03:19.850
<b>but I'm going to crush that bastard
who took away my sister.</b>

03:20.930 --> 03:21.950
<b>Um...</b>

03:22.270 --> 03:25.080
<b>Why do you believe
your sister was kidnapped?</b>

03:25.080 --> 03:29.630
<b>Each time I try, my magic is
interrupted by some strong force.</b>

03:30.130 --> 03:34.870
<b>I'm sure some sick pervert has imprisoned
my sister and trying to stop me!</b>

03:34.900 --> 03:36.860
<b>Mwahahaha...</b>

03:36.910 --> 03:38.840
<b>I don't care who this
bastard out there is.</b>

03:38.990 --> 03:42.040
<b>I'll make sure I find them and
tear them apart limb by limb!</b>

03:42.890 --> 03:46.130
<b>A-Allen will be torn apart limb by limb!</b>

03:46.540 --> 03:49.340
<b>I will definitely find my sister someday.</b>

03:49.730 --> 03:52.940
<b>I have to become stronger
so I can make it happen!</b>

03:54.260 --> 03:55.510
<b>It'll be fine.</b>

03:56.010 --> 03:58.100
<b>I'm sure you'll be able
to find your sister.</b>

03:59.100 --> 04:00.200
<b>How strange.</b>

04:01.020 --> 04:04.350
<b>Charo, you and I are
strangers who just met,</b>

04:05.230 --> 04:07.250
<b>but you somehow make me feel nostalgic.</b>

04:09.170 --> 04:10.980
<b>I'm sure that's because I...</b>

04:13.150 --> 04:16.170
<b>I'm sorry, Natalia!</b>

04:16.170 --> 04:17.410
<b>C-Chris?!</b>

04:17.740 --> 04:19.630
<b>I didn't know something
like that happened to you!</b>

04:19.870 --> 04:22.050
<b>I'm such an idiot!</b>

04:22.050 --> 04:24.460
<b>I'm sorry! Please forgive me!</b>

04:24.960 --> 04:27.600
<b>Anyway, we have to
escape from this dungeon...</b>

04:33.900 --> 04:35.480
<b>Could that be that thing earlier?</b>

04:43.640 --> 04:44.480
<b>A salamander!</b>

04:44.730 --> 04:46.560
<b>This is this dungeon's boss?!</b>

04:47.690 --> 04:48.750
<b>Charo?</b>

04:48.980 --> 04:51.220
<b>I'm going to divert
this beast's attention!</b>

04:51.980 --> 04:54.090
<b>Use that opportunity
to go call Allen here!</b>

04:54.320 --> 04:55.200
<b>I can't let that!</b>

04:55.360 --> 04:57.210
<b>Your opponent is a dangerous monster!</b>

04:57.860 --> 04:59.570
<b>I will protect you!</b>

05:01.510 --> 05:02.220
<b>Chris!</b>

05:02.850 --> 05:04.580
<b>Her leg is injured.</b>

05:04.750 --> 05:06.060
<b>Please escape along with her!</b>

05:06.250 --> 05:07.970
<b>O-Okay!</b>

05:07.970 --> 05:09.060
<b>No!</b>

05:09.170 --> 05:10.880
<b>I can't let you be alone here!</b>

05:11.090 --> 05:13.260
<b>Please just listen to me, Natalia!</b>

05:15.470 --> 05:16.340
<b>Chris...</b>

05:16.840 --> 05:18.640
<b>Let's go, Natalia.</b>

05:19.760 --> 05:20.850
<b>It'll be fine.</b>

05:21.470 --> 05:23.470
<b>I'm going to protect Natalia!</b>

05:29.150 --> 05:29.900
<b>Over here!</b>

05:31.270 --> 05:32.860
<b>Come on, over here!</b>

05:37.860 --> 05:38.780
<b>Charo?!</b>

05:41.780 --> 05:43.410
<b>Huh? My sister?</b>

05:45.700 --> 05:46.500
<b>Charo!</b>

05:48.460 --> 05:49.120
<b>- Huh?
- Huh?</b>

05:57.420 --> 06:00.280
<b>Is it you? The one who hurt Charlotte?</b>

06:05.970 --> 06:07.810
<b>What's with this power...</b>

06:08.190 --> 06:10.440
<b>So this is the power of
the Great Demon Lord?</b>

06:12.900 --> 06:15.290
<b>Daddy, could this be...</b>

06:15.290 --> 06:17.710
<b>Yes, I have no doubt it's Allen.</b>

06:18.490 --> 06:20.630
<b>I hope he doesn't
destroy the school building.</b>

06:20.820 --> 06:21.530
<b>Huh?!</b>

06:23.030 --> 06:23.950
<b>No problem.</b>

06:24.370 --> 06:26.090
<b>Defeating it is easy.</b>

06:35.310 --> 06:36.590
<b>G-Great Demon Lord!</b>

06:37.050 --> 06:37.760
<b>- Huh?
- Huh?</b>

06:40.030 --> 06:41.150
<b>Ugh, dammit!</b>

06:41.380 --> 06:43.050
<b>I told you to sit!</b>

06:43.760 --> 06:45.140
<b>What in the world is...</b>

06:45.510 --> 06:46.620
<b>You shouldn't have done that.</b>

06:46.910 --> 06:49.330
<b>Right now,
this place is off-limits to students.</b>

06:49.480 --> 06:52.650
<b>The only one who can enter is
the monster studies teacher, me.</b>

06:52.850 --> 06:53.980
<b>Mrs. Lise...</b>

06:54.270 --> 06:56.960
<b>The salamander is acting strange!</b>

06:57.530 --> 06:59.490
<b>Oh, dear, Pochi...</b>

06:59.950 --> 07:02.320
<b>I guess you've remembered
about Allen, huh?</b>

07:02.820 --> 07:05.830
<b>He's your daddy who raised you
since you were an egg, after all.</b>

07:05.830 --> 07:06.870
<b>- What?!
- Huh?!</b>

07:12.670 --> 07:13.710
<b>Charlotte...</b>

07:14.380 --> 07:15.290
<b>You did great.</b>

07:17.460 --> 07:18.340
<b>Chairman!</b>

07:18.760 --> 07:20.130
<b>I'm very sorry!</b>

07:20.550 --> 07:22.110
<b>I take responsibility for everything!</b>

07:22.630 --> 07:24.340
<b>I'll accept any punishment!</b>

07:25.930 --> 07:27.950
<b>Seems like you've
learned your lesson, too.</b>

07:29.680 --> 07:31.740
<b>Great Demon Lord, um...</b>

07:31.740 --> 07:33.810
<b>Come on.
It's time for your heartfelt reunion.</b>

07:39.480 --> 07:41.030
<b>Allen... I...</b>

07:41.740 --> 07:44.110
<b>Look, Natalia is worried about you.</b>

07:47.240 --> 07:49.640
<b>I'm glad you're safe, Natalia.</b>

07:49.950 --> 07:51.720
<b>Wait, what? My glasses...</b>

07:51.960 --> 07:53.460
<b>My hair color is back to normal, too...</b>

07:53.920 --> 07:55.500
<b>So you're really...</b>

07:58.500 --> 08:00.170
<b>I'm sorry for deceiving you.</b>

08:00.960 --> 08:04.680
<b>I feel like I've caused you
a lot of trouble.</b>

08:06.140 --> 08:08.030
<b>That's why I've always
wanted to apologize...</b>

08:09.060 --> 08:11.850
<b>My sister...
You're really my sister, right?</b>

08:12.270 --> 08:12.930
<b>Yes...</b>

08:13.730 --> 08:15.310
<b>Then, um...</b>

08:15.690 --> 08:18.480
<b>What's the picture book
you used to read me about?</b>

08:19.020 --> 08:21.230
<b>About the zoo, right?</b>

08:23.110 --> 08:25.410
<b>The book where
the children go to the zoo...</b>

08:26.110 --> 08:28.090
<b>I realized one day that I've lost it.</b>

08:28.260 --> 08:29.880
<b>It must've been thrown away...</b>

08:31.290 --> 08:32.290
<b>Natalia?</b>

08:33.850 --> 08:34.700
<b>That's...</b>

08:34.910 --> 08:37.880
<b>It was going to be
thrown away, so I hid it.</b>

08:38.890 --> 08:40.420
<b>One more time...</b>

08:41.000 --> 08:42.510
<b>Just one more time.</b>

08:42.730 --> 08:46.260
<b>I want you to read me this book again!</b>

08:47.930 --> 08:48.640
<b>Natalia!</b>

08:49.850 --> 08:51.390
<b>I'm sorry, sister...</b>

08:51.850 --> 08:53.780
<b>I couldn't save you all this time.</b>

08:54.020 --> 08:55.080
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

08:55.700 --> 08:56.520
<b>I'm also...</b>

08:57.270 --> 09:00.610
<b>I'm also sorry for leaving you alone.</b>

09:04.240 --> 09:05.630
<b>That's great, mama.</b>

09:05.820 --> 09:07.530
<b>A grand finale.</b>

09:10.330 --> 09:13.330
<b>Thank you for everything, Mr. Allen.</b>

09:13.790 --> 09:15.620
<b>You won't call me
the Great Demon Lord anymore?</b>

09:15.870 --> 09:17.710
<b>You're our lifesaver, so...</b>

09:18.790 --> 09:21.210
<b>I didn't expect you to be
the one who saved her.</b>

09:23.460 --> 09:24.510
<b>That's right.</b>

09:25.090 --> 09:27.150
<b>Allen is my lifesaver.</b>

09:27.800 --> 09:30.220
<b>And now, he's also my precious...</b>

09:32.680 --> 09:34.450
<b>Hm? Precious?</b>

09:34.680 --> 09:36.230
<b>You mean he's your boyfriend, right?</b>

09:36.520 --> 09:38.650
<b>You two are dating, after all.</b>

09:39.270 --> 09:40.110
<b>Huh?</b>

09:40.310 --> 09:42.210
<b>I-It's not like that, Natalia!</b>

09:42.210 --> 09:43.230
<b>Right now, uh...</b>

09:43.650 --> 09:44.960
<b>Ack! What's wrong?!</b>

09:45.400 --> 09:47.170
<b>So it's you!</b>

09:47.170 --> 09:48.850
<b>Don't you dare ask me what's wrong!</b>

09:48.850 --> 09:52.550
<b>So that's the reason why I couldn't find
my sister even after searching with magic!</b>

09:52.630 --> 09:55.050
<b>You approached her with
that goal in mind from the start, right?!</b>

09:55.330 --> 09:57.140
<b>My sister...</b>

09:57.500 --> 09:59.890
<b>What did you do to her, bastard?!</b>

09:59.970 --> 10:02.140
<b>No! This is a misunderstanding, Natalia!</b>

10:02.310 --> 10:03.900
<b>Don't take it seriously!</b>

10:04.250 --> 10:06.940
<b>Someone! Someone please stop her!</b>

10:06.940 --> 10:08.220
<b>Let's leave them be.</b>

10:08.220 --> 10:10.610
<b>Now that we're all back together,</b>

10:10.610 --> 10:12.860
<b>shall we go get something nice to eat?</b>

10:12.860 --> 10:15.390
<b>Yay! I'm starving!</b>

10:15.680 --> 10:17.430
<b>We won't survive
if we get dragged into this.</b>

10:17.430 --> 10:19.160
<b>Should we also go to the cafeteria?</b>

10:19.160 --> 10:22.270
<b>Let me treat you as
an apology for all the trouble!</b>

10:22.910 --> 10:23.980
<b>Still,</b>

10:24.290 --> 10:26.990
<b>I can't believe
their relationship was a lie.</b>

10:27.440 --> 10:29.200
<b>What a shame.</b>

10:29.570 --> 10:31.420
<b>Sorry for lying to you.</b>

10:31.910 --> 10:34.740
<b>But it's true that they both
have feelings for each other.</b>

10:35.290 --> 10:37.120
<b>Tearing your limbs apart is not enough!</b>

10:37.120 --> 10:40.250
<b>I'll make sure you'll never breathe again!</b>

10:42.920 --> 10:43.770
<b>So, you know.</b>

10:43.880 --> 10:45.960
<b>Until they can tell each other
about their feelings,</b>

10:46.210 --> 10:47.960
<b>let's wait patiently and watch over them.</b>

10:50.940 --> 10:53.930
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady
I Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

10:53.930 --> 10:56.930
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady
I Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

10:59.580 --> 11:03.120
<b>It's been a while since
we've spent time like this.</b>

11:03.350 --> 11:05.670
<b>Yeah. It's calm and peaceful.</b>

11:05.940 --> 11:07.150
<b>Right...</b>

11:07.940 --> 11:09.440
<b>The problem is all solved,</b>

11:09.530 --> 11:11.420
<b>so we went back home,
which is good, but...</b>

11:11.740 --> 11:13.780
<b>Just one thing is still bugging me.</b>

11:14.620 --> 11:19.120
<b>That night, why did Charlotte want
to make sure about my feelings?</b>

11:19.870 --> 11:23.680
<b>What were you going to say back then?</b>

11:24.960 --> 11:27.380
<b>That thing I couldn't ask
Allen about that night...</b>

11:28.000 --> 11:29.460
<b>I really want to ask him about it.</b>

11:30.400 --> 11:31.730
<b>But right now, it's still too...</b>

11:33.260 --> 11:33.970
<b>- Um...
- Uh...</b>

11:36.260 --> 11:38.010
<b>Hello, meow!</b>

11:40.680 --> 11:43.980
<b>Demon Lord, Charlotte! It's been a while!</b>

11:44.520 --> 11:46.400
<b>It's been a while, Miach.</b>

11:46.770 --> 11:48.710
<b>You haven't appeared for six episodes.</b>

11:48.940 --> 11:49.920
<b>Why are you here?</b>

11:50.280 --> 11:52.270
<b>A delivery, of course!</b>

11:54.720 --> 11:57.220
<b>Miach from Satyrus Delivery Service, out!</b>

11:58.310 --> 11:59.740
<b>Go out from the main entrance!</b>

12:00.540 --> 12:01.410
<b>Allen,</b>

12:01.790 --> 12:05.040
<b>the sender of
this package isn't written on it.</b>

12:05.150 --> 12:07.480
<b>Who sent this, I wonder?</b>

12:08.500 --> 12:09.900
<b>Is this a magic circle?</b>

12:09.900 --> 12:10.980
<b>Yeah, let me have a look.</b>

12:16.260 --> 12:17.150
<b>Allen?</b>

12:17.300 --> 12:19.100
<b>This is a summoning spell!</b>

12:19.490 --> 12:20.470
<b>Summoning?</b>

12:20.930 --> 12:22.310
<b>Stand back, Charlotte!</b>

12:25.270 --> 12:26.940
<b>Sister!</b>

12:28.020 --> 12:29.790
<b>Have you been well, sister?</b>

12:29.940 --> 12:31.820
<b>Natalia! Why are you...</b>

12:32.360 --> 12:34.670
<b>The surprise was a success!</b>

12:34.670 --> 12:35.910
<b>That's right!</b>

12:36.200 --> 12:37.970
<b>Eluka, Miach...</b>

12:38.160 --> 12:40.370
<b>What do you mean by surprise?</b>

12:40.990 --> 12:44.180
<b>Natalia told us she wants to come visit.</b>

12:44.290 --> 12:46.520
<b>So we thought we'd
surprise you while we're at it!</b>

12:46.620 --> 12:48.310
<b>Miach also helped!</b>

12:48.500 --> 12:50.210
<b>That's how it is!</b>

12:50.550 --> 12:53.150
<b>Thank you for your help!</b>

12:54.840 --> 12:56.900
<b>So? Where's the Great Demon Lord?</b>

12:57.010 --> 13:00.820
<b>If he's not here, I can have you
all for myself, so that would be nice.</b>

13:00.890 --> 13:02.540
<b>I'm... over here....</b>

13:04.230 --> 13:06.690
<b>Oh, you're not dead yet?</b>

13:07.150 --> 13:10.540
<b>Then, I will make you give up on
pursuing a relationship with my sister...</b>

13:10.650 --> 13:12.160
<b>...by taking your life here and...</b>

13:12.160 --> 13:14.250
<b>Wait! T-That was a misunderstanding!</b>

13:14.250 --> 13:16.030
<b>Fighting is not good, okay?</b>

13:16.320 --> 13:17.910
<b>No, sis.</b>

13:18.160 --> 13:21.200
<b>This is just a passionate message
from his beloved apprentice.</b>

13:21.830 --> 13:23.580
<b>What do you mean, beloved apprentice?</b>

13:23.910 --> 13:25.500
<b>You're just trying to stir up a fight.</b>

13:26.290 --> 13:28.040
<b>The boss in this house is me.</b>

13:28.500 --> 13:30.640
<b>If you're not going to
listen to this house's owner,</b>

13:30.790 --> 13:32.730
<b>then I'll have to make you leave by force!</b>

13:33.380 --> 13:35.470
<b>Oh? Just what I wanted.</b>

13:39.220 --> 13:41.220
<b>Please help me!</b>

13:41.220 --> 13:42.140
<b>Dorothea?</b>

13:42.140 --> 13:44.240
<b>Long time no see, Charlotte.</b>

13:44.240 --> 13:46.140
<b>Sorry for barging in out of nowhere.</b>

13:46.770 --> 13:48.190
<b>B-By "Dorothea", you mean...</b>

13:48.190 --> 13:49.280
<b>Are you possibly...</b>

13:49.480 --> 13:52.620
<b>...that Dorothea Grimm Valenstein?!</b>

13:52.940 --> 13:54.000
<b>Yeah, that's right.</b>

13:54.000 --> 13:55.130
<b>Meow?!</b>

13:55.230 --> 13:59.160
<b>It's that famous novelist who
has published a bunch of novels!</b>

13:59.410 --> 14:01.810
<b>I've also heard her name before.</b>

14:02.240 --> 14:04.870
<b>Ah, you're all making me blush...</b>

14:05.290 --> 14:06.660
<b>So? Where's Allen?</b>

14:06.830 --> 14:08.130
<b>I'm... over here...</b>

14:12.460 --> 14:14.900
<b>I-It's been a while, Allen.</b>

14:15.130 --> 14:17.880
<b>Here, have my new novel as a souvenir...</b>

14:18.300 --> 14:22.050
<b>Sis, why do you and
that author know each other?</b>

14:22.390 --> 14:25.140
<b>She used to live in this house before us.</b>

14:25.810 --> 14:27.200
<b>That's right!</b>

14:27.310 --> 14:31.490
<b>I used them as inspiration
for my new novel.</b>

14:31.490 --> 14:33.650
<b>It sold like hotcakes!</b>

14:34.110 --> 14:36.110
<b>I wanna publish a sequel soon.</b>

14:36.480 --> 14:39.150
<b>Has there been any
new development since then?</b>

14:39.360 --> 14:41.360
<b>About that, um....</b>

14:41.360 --> 14:42.130
<b>Development?</b>

14:42.240 --> 14:44.910
<b>So? Why are you here?</b>

14:45.300 --> 14:46.840
<b>This is awful!</b>

14:46.910 --> 14:50.920
<b>My editor-in-charge, Yoru,
has been pressuring me about the sequel...</b>

14:51.290 --> 14:53.790
<b>Please let me hide in this house!</b>

14:54.090 --> 14:54.880
<b>I refuse!</b>

14:55.210 --> 14:57.780
<b>I don't want my wall
to get destroyed again!</b>

14:57.780 --> 14:59.270
<b>Oh, come on!</b>

14:59.270 --> 15:01.360
<b>Take pity on her, Demon Lord.</b>

15:01.360 --> 15:02.990
<b>That's right, brother.</b>

15:03.050 --> 15:05.110
<b>Natalia is also
staying here tonight, anyway.</b>

15:05.220 --> 15:07.560
<b>One additional person
shouldn't be a problem, right?</b>

15:07.970 --> 15:10.000
<b>Why is she staying here?</b>

15:10.000 --> 15:11.040
<b>That's obvious!</b>

15:11.410 --> 15:15.860
<b>I need to keep watch so that you won't
do any naughty stuff to my sister!</b>

15:16.520 --> 15:18.420
<b>Natalia is staying overnight here!</b>

15:18.650 --> 15:20.280
<b>Play a lot with me!</b>

15:20.400 --> 15:22.780
<b>Tonight looks like it will be lively.</b>

15:23.200 --> 15:26.260
<b>I'll prepare you your favorite dishes.</b>

15:26.260 --> 15:28.830
<b>Don't just continue
the conversation without me!</b>

15:29.450 --> 15:30.410
<b>Gousetsu,</b>

15:30.660 --> 15:32.080
<b>you can cook?</b>

15:34.130 --> 15:36.750
<b>Then, I guess we'll all
enjoy dinner together.</b>

15:38.170 --> 15:39.760
<b>Alright!</b>

15:59.900 --> 16:00.990
<b>This place is...</b>

16:02.200 --> 16:03.320
<b>That's right.</b>

16:03.740 --> 16:07.530
<b>Mother thought I stole
something from the house and...</b>

16:11.890 --> 16:14.010
<b>I'm scared. I'm scared.</b>

16:14.270 --> 16:15.480
<b>I hate the dark.</b>

16:16.420 --> 16:17.630
<b>I hate pain.</b>

16:18.140 --> 16:20.150
<b>I hate being lonely even more.</b>

16:21.210 --> 16:22.050
<b>But...</b>

16:22.510 --> 16:24.800
<b>...no one will hurt me here.</b>

16:26.640 --> 16:29.430
<b>I can breathe easier here than outside.</b>

16:30.470 --> 16:32.890
<b>If I just let the darkness
swallow me here...</b>

16:33.740 --> 16:34.990
<b>Charlotte...</b>

16:36.060 --> 16:37.210
<b>Charlotte...</b>

16:37.650 --> 16:38.770
<b>Charlotte.</b>

16:48.320 --> 16:50.200
<b>Y-You're...</b>

16:52.290 --> 16:53.800
<b>I'm the Great Demon Lord.</b>

16:54.720 --> 16:57.060
<b>I've come here to take you away.</b>

17:13.600 --> 17:15.310
<b>It's been a while since I had that dream.</b>

17:16.310 --> 17:18.350
<b>That scary dream from back then...</b>

17:20.860 --> 17:21.690
<b>But...</b>

17:25.530 --> 17:27.070
<b>Hm? What's wrong?</b>

17:27.490 --> 17:29.420
<b>I woke myself up.</b>

17:30.120 --> 17:31.910
<b>Are you working, Allen?</b>

17:32.580 --> 17:36.660
<b>No, if I keep going until this late
my head won't be as sharp.</b>

17:37.250 --> 17:38.170
<b>You can't fall asleep?</b>

17:38.750 --> 17:40.460
<b>Can I stay with you?</b>

17:40.960 --> 17:41.630
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:42.090 --> 17:44.520
<b>Oh, right. This is a good opportunity.</b>

17:44.520 --> 17:46.070
<b>Let's do that thing tonight.</b>

17:46.380 --> 17:47.090
<b>That thing?</b>

17:47.820 --> 17:49.110
<b>Of course it's...</b>

17:49.430 --> 17:50.990
<b>...that thing you can only do at night.</b>

17:51.220 --> 17:52.610
<b>That naughty act.</b>

17:53.180 --> 17:55.470
<b>A naughty act...
that you can only do at night?</b>

18:06.360 --> 18:08.360
<b>Here. It's hot, so be careful.</b>

18:09.160 --> 18:11.630
<b>What a nice aroma.
This is hot chocolate, right?</b>

18:11.990 --> 18:12.910
<b>Exactly.</b>

18:13.330 --> 18:16.160
<b>Let's drink that as we gaze at the stars.</b>

18:21.130 --> 18:23.840
<b>So this is the naughty act
you can only do at night?</b>

18:24.340 --> 18:25.350
<b>It's wonderful.</b>

18:25.920 --> 18:28.190
<b>Well, I said we'll gaze at the stars,</b>

18:28.300 --> 18:30.300
<b>but I don't know much about them.</b>

18:30.930 --> 18:33.390
<b>Aren't you knowledgeable about everything?</b>

18:33.720 --> 18:37.280
<b>I know well that the positioning of stars
is one of the things that give you magic energy.</b>

18:37.430 --> 18:40.560
<b>But star signs and its other myths
are all nonsense to me.</b>

18:40.940 --> 18:42.520
<b>That's just like you, Allen.</b>

18:43.610 --> 18:48.240
<b>Um, that one with the yellow light
is the eye part of the spider.</b>

18:48.950 --> 18:51.950
<b>And below that,
there's the infernal capybara.</b>

18:53.870 --> 18:57.180
<b>They all just look like
a bunch of dots to me.</b>

18:59.790 --> 19:01.620
<b>Something was glowing for a second there!</b>

19:01.920 --> 19:03.250
<b>Maybe it's a shooting star?</b>

19:04.380 --> 19:05.190
<b>Where?</b>

19:07.760 --> 19:09.010
<b>Allen...</b>

19:14.930 --> 19:15.680
<b>Um...</b>

19:16.110 --> 19:17.280
<b>You don't hate it?</b>

19:17.680 --> 19:18.470
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:19.310 --> 19:21.810
<b>I've never hated it even once.</b>

19:23.750 --> 19:24.520
<b>I see.</b>

19:38.040 --> 19:38.870
<b>Allen...</b>

19:40.540 --> 19:42.370
<b>Thank you for everything.</b>

19:46.880 --> 19:49.550
<b>Drinking sweet hot chocolate
while gazing at the stars...</b>

19:50.670 --> 19:52.550
<b>What a naughty thing to do.</b>

19:53.130 --> 19:54.930
<b>This much is nothing.</b>

19:55.200 --> 19:55.850
<b>Huh?</b>

19:56.850 --> 19:57.680
<b>I told you.</b>

19:58.430 --> 20:02.230
<b>I'll teach you all the naughty things
there is in this world.</b>

20:02.730 --> 20:04.230
<b>Not just about this.</b>

20:05.730 --> 20:09.530
<b>Lately, I've been looking forward
for the next morning to come.</b>

20:10.610 --> 20:14.740
<b>I'd wonder what happiness
you'll teach me that day...</b>

20:16.160 --> 20:19.120
<b>I'm glad I met you, Allen.</b>

20:24.460 --> 20:27.080
<b>If you don't wear your blanket properly,
you'll catch a cold.</b>

20:28.440 --> 20:29.650
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:35.090 --> 20:36.140
<b>Allen...</b>

20:38.300 --> 20:39.600
<b>Charlotte...</b>

20:49.080 --> 20:51.580
<b>Alright, come out, all of you!</b>

20:52.710 --> 20:54.040
<b>We got found out!</b>

20:54.040 --> 20:55.650
<b>As I would expect from the Demon Lord!</b>

20:55.650 --> 20:58.780
<b>It was so warm to the point of
me not feeling the cold of the night!</b>

20:59.080 --> 21:02.180
<b>Whispering words of love to each other
under the beautiful starry night...</b>

21:02.330 --> 21:04.430
<b>You've sure got some tricks, Allen.</b>

21:04.620 --> 21:07.440
<b>Trying to have mama all for yourself
while everyone's asleep...</b>

21:07.440 --> 21:08.100
<b>That's right...</b>

21:08.100 --> 21:09.980
<b>I'm not trying to do that!</b>

21:09.980 --> 21:11.800
<b>You really aren't?</b>

21:11.800 --> 21:16.280
<b>But weren't you holding hands?</b>

21:16.470 --> 21:17.740
<b>Great Demon Lord...</b>

21:17.740 --> 21:19.600
<b>In order to keep you away from my sister,</b>

21:19.600 --> 21:22.280
<b>I'll have to tear
that arm off of your body now!</b>

21:22.660 --> 21:24.310
<b>Stop it! That's dangerous!</b>

21:24.310 --> 21:25.990
<b>I'll also attack you, Allen!</b>

21:25.990 --> 21:27.460
<b>Mama is mine!</b>

21:27.460 --> 21:28.870
<b>- That's right!
- Sure, then.</b>

21:28.870 --> 21:31.230
<b>I'll also join the fight!</b>

21:31.230 --> 21:33.780
<b>I have no choice if it's like this!
Come at me!</b>

21:33.780 --> 21:36.340
<b>I'll handle every single one of you!</b>

21:50.210 --> 21:52.100
<b>There's a report from our spy.</b>

21:52.590 --> 21:54.730
<b>We've finally found out where she is.</b>

21:55.050 --> 21:56.010
<b>I see.</b>

21:57.170 --> 22:01.140
<b>Under the name of the Neils Kingdom,
Capture her straight away.</b>

22:01.300 --> 22:02.010
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

22:04.600 --> 22:05.770
<b>Just you wait,</b>

22:06.230 --> 22:07.350
<b>Charlotte.</b>
